**Magical Fairies** can be helpful or mischievous, and it's hard to
tell which kind you've met -- their riddling, singsong way of talking
certainly doesn't help. *Charismatic +1, Cute! +1, Flight +2, Magic,
Arcane +1, Quick +2; Awkward Size -3 (Tiny), Frail -1, Quirk -1
(Nonsensical Talk), Weak -2.*

